---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About Saumya Tours | Pita Kotte, Sri Lanka"
  description="Meet Saumya Tours in Pita Kotte, Sri Lanka — direct local vehicle hires, Sri Lanka guided journeys, and Dambadiva Buddhist pilgrimages."
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'About', href: '/about' }]}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</p>
      <h1>Based in Pita Kotte. Built around real conversations.</h1>
      <p>We arrange local vehicle hires, Sri Lanka island journeys, and Buddhist pilgrimages across India and Nepal with clear written details upfront.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container story-split">
      <div class="story-image">
        <img src="/images/dambadiva.webp" alt="Pilgrims gathered in devotion at the Mahabodhi Temple" width="900" height="720" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="story-copy">
        <h2>Different journeys, the same practical care.</h2>
        <p>
          Whether you are booking a Nissan Caravan for an early airport run, requesting our Mercedes-Benz AMG C-Class for a family wedding, or planning a Dambadiva pilgrimage with elderly parents, the practical details decide how comfortable the journey feels.
        </p>
        <p>
          We listen to who is traveling, talk through walking distances, luggage, vehicle setup, and rest stops, and put your route and quote in writing before you make a commitment.
        </p>
        <div class="story-signature">The Saumya Tours team</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-stone">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <h2>How we work</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value">
          <h3>Listening first</h3>
          <p>Your route, group size, budget, and comfort shape the recommendation before any quote is prepared.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value">
          <h3>Written quotes</h3>
          <p>Every arrangement clarifies vehicle, stops, inclusions, waiting terms, and cancellation policies upfront.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value">
          <h3>Respect for place</h3>
          <p>We plan thoughtfully around sacred temple protocols, wildlife park rules, and local communities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <h2>Where to start</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value">
          <h3>Local vehicle hire</h3>
          <p>Request our Nissan Caravan or Mercedes-Benz AMG C-Class for transfers, outings, or events from Pita Kotte.</p>
          <a href="/local-hires" class="text-link">Plan a local hire</a>
        </div>
        <div class="value">
          <h3>Sri Lanka journeys</h3>
          <p>Culture, hill country, coast, and wildlife routes shaped around your group’s pace.</p>
          <a href="/tours?category=sri-lanka-tours" class="text-link">View island journeys</a>
        </div>
        <div class="value">
          <h3>Dambadiva pilgrimages</h3>
          <p>Sacred Buddhist sites across India and Nepal, planned with time for reflection and worship.</p>
          <a href="/dambadiva-tours" class="text-link">Explore pilgrimages</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
